\section{Summary}
\subsection{}
    Infrastructure and Inference Engineer with \textbf{5+ years} of experience building and scaling \textbf{high-traffic AWS infrastructure}, \textbf{GPU-based inference systems}, and production \textbf{Kubernetes} platforms. Proven track record in \textbf{load testing at 10M+ TPM scale}, self-hosting ML/LLM models (\textbf{vLLM}) serving \textbf{30\% of production traffic}, shipping \textbf{real-time voice-AI over WebRTC}, and driving \textbf{68\% inference cost reductions}. Strong in \textbf{Terraform IaC}, \textbf{CI/CD automation}, and \textbf{cloud security hardening}.

