\section{Experience}

%%%%%%% ----------------------------------- Role 5 ----------------------------------- %%%%%%%
\subsection*{Senior DevOps Engineer, Primetrace \hfill Dec 2024 --- Present}
    \begin{zitemize}
        \item Owned \textbf{end-to-end load testing} for Crafto's peak traffic events, preparing the platform to handle \textbf{$\sim$10M TPM}; system scaled to \textbf{1.6M concurrent users} and \textbf{6M DAU}, supporting \textbf{INR 4Cr revenue in 36 hours}.
        \item Deployed \textbf{self-hosted inference} models (\textbf{flux2-dev-32b 4-bit quantised}, \textbf{flux2-klein-4b}) and LLMs (\textbf{Gemma 26B via vLLM}) now serving \textbf{30\% of production traffic}, reducing per-inference cost from \textbf{INR 3.5--4 to INR 0.8}.
        \item Optimized \textbf{GPU infrastructure} for Pixora upscaling from \textbf{2$\times$A100 80GB (\$11/hr)} to \textbf{1$\times$L40S (\$3.5/hr)} --- \textbf{68\% cost reduction}. Moved Sundar AI \& Looks AI upscaling fully self-hosted, eliminating \textbf{\$3,200/mo} Replicate spend.
        \item Built the production \textbf{WebRTC media infrastructure} on \textbf{EKS} powering real-time voice-AI calls --- stood up a \textbf{coturn} TURN/STUN relay behind an internet-facing \textbf{NLB} to carry \textbf{SRTP/UDP} audio into private-subnet pods, enabling \textbf{sub-second-latency} Android$\leftrightarrow$AI voice.
        \item Built \textbf{Android CI/CD} end-to-end via \textbf{GitHub Actions + Slack}, replacing manual builds --- now critical infrastructure for the entire Crafto Android team.
        \item Completed \textbf{zero-downtime MySQL upgrade} (\textbf{8.0.42 $\rightarrow$ 8.4.7}) on major production DB; created reusable \textbf{Terraform module} for \textbf{EKS Pod Identity} reducing setup from 3 resources to 1 declaration (\textbf{3$\times$ productivity}).
        \item Diagnosed and resolved a \textbf{critical InnoDB history-length runaway} on a production MySQL DB --- traced to \textbf{long-running transactions} under \textbf{REPEATABLE READ} blocking \textbf{undo-log purge}, restoring purge throughput.
        \item Rolled out \textbf{KEDA} event-driven autoscaling across most production workers with tuned \textbf{Marbot} alerting, right-sizing capacity to queue depth.
        \item Rolled out \textbf{AWS WAF} to production for Kutumb/Labs --- analysed multi-day \textbf{WAF logs} across iterations to eliminate false positives, then cut over to \textbf{block mode} on prod with \textbf{zero downtime}.
    \end{zitemize}

